{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/466e3262bf549396a25737e9384390df.poster.avif?t=1757868469\" width=616 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/466e3262bf549396a25737e9384390df.webm?t=1757868469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create the Perfect Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ally has their own ability, event outcomes and synergies... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, draft carefully: because without knowing how to scale your team to victory, you'll end up as a snack for the bigger threats which lurk further within the woods...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/27679c4abbf7698904e96d069232b740.poster.avif?t=1757868469\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/27679c4abbf7698904e96d069232b740.webm?t=1757868469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/27679c4abbf7698904e96d069232b740.mp4?t=1757868469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Snappy Runs, Deep Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the quick pace is a layered roguelite system that rewards planning and adaptability.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Runs take only 10 minutes once mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful scaling combos as your run unfolds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics unlock over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Easy to learn, endlessly replayable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/91938b86b3c9d861f5f91ba7a4b6cd8f.poster.avif?t=1757868469\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/91938b86b3c9d861f5f91ba7a4b6cd8f.apng?t=1757868469\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map Navigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tread carefully, for the forest is fickle... and the fog will always follow. Every tile is a choice.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize the right tiles for your team's needs\u00a0while knowing when to improvise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for the creeping fog which closes in from the edge of the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clever decision-making can make (or break!) your run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/79c4ac738f5908cfa2ebf9810cb030f9.poster.avif?t=1757868469\" width=448 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667720/extras/79c4ac738f5908cfa2ebf9810cb030f9.webm?t=1757868469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceptively simple rules combine into a game that's both familiar and unique, full of secrets and challenges... do you believe you have what it takes to overcome the enchanted forest?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images